id=adg_unmount_tmpfs
name=AdGuard tmpfs unmount
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=Rakoczi
description=Unmounts the leftover /data/local/tmp/adg-ca-copy tmpfs (created by the adguardcert module) from the init and zygote mount namespaces after boot. The CA bind mount stays in place, so HTTPS filtering keeps working.
